    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base for a concrete WASM execution engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementors wrap Wasmtime, WasmEdge, wasm3, or any other engine. When no runtime is registered, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_wasm_plugin_sandbox" kindref="compound">WasmPluginSandbox</ref> operates in <bold>validation-only mode</bold>: it checks the binary format and enforces the host-function allowlist but cannot execute WASM code. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
